WEBVTT

00:00:08.510 --> 00:00:15.770
Well, another transfer student has come.

00:00:17.010 --> 00:00:20.710
I'm Yuki Nekoyashiki. Nice to meet you.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.360
Yuki can play in the same class as me, right?

00:00:32.970 --> 00:00:35.440
The school is a place to study.

00:00:35.780 --> 00:00:37.000
Oh, that's right.

00:00:38.120 --> 00:00:39.260
You're a friend of Komugi-chan.

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:41.240
Are you a relative of the cat house?

00:00:42.330 --> 00:00:44.400
That's right. I'm a cousin.

00:00:44.780 --> 00:00:48.660
Then, Yuki-san, next to Komugi-san...

00:01:00.890 --> 00:01:01.330
Ah...

00:01:01.330 --> 00:01:01.830
What?

00:01:11.120 --> 00:01:11.420
And...

00:01:12.210 --> 00:01:15.030
Ah, I see.

00:01:15.070 --> 00:01:17.400
For Yuki, this is the normal way.

00:01:27.370 --> 00:01:27.530
There.

00:01:27.750 --> 00:01:28.180
Can you move?

00:01:32.140 --> 00:01:32.420
It's here!

00:03:11.260 --> 00:03:13.260
Thank you for watching.

00:03:17.852 --> 00:03:18.852
I'll teach you!

00:03:22.972 --> 00:03:23.472
It's fast!

00:03:23.772 --> 00:03:27.972
I've been wondering about it for a while, but what is that wonderful thing?

00:03:28.348 --> 00:03:29.988
WONDERFUL ONE WONDERFUL

00:03:30.540 --> 00:03:33.440
Wandaful is a feeling called Wandaful.

00:03:34.000 --> 00:03:34.520
Hmm.

00:03:34.700 --> 00:03:36.960
I don't understand anything.

00:03:37.400 --> 00:03:40.540
Wandaful has the meaning of wonderful and amazing.

00:03:41.630 --> 00:03:42.750
That's right!

00:03:43.210 --> 00:03:44.460
Did you use it without knowing?

00:03:44.720 --> 00:03:45.880
Yuki will soon understand.

00:03:46.820 --> 00:03:50.150
Because we are Wandaful Precure.

00:03:52.400 --> 00:03:54.260
Wandaful Precure?

00:03:54.380 --> 00:03:55.410
I refuse.

00:03:55.930 --> 00:03:56.070
What?

00:03:56.270 --> 00:03:56.570
Why?

00:03:57.980 --> 00:03:58.940
I'm a cat.

00:04:00.510 --> 00:04:01.270
Huh?

00:04:03.100 --> 00:04:04.380
Then what should I do?

00:04:05.710 --> 00:04:09.550
I-I didn't tell you!

00:04:10.540 --> 00:04:12.060
I didn't ask you to tell me.

00:04:12.200 --> 00:04:14.930
It's easy to pretend to be a human.

00:04:30.060 --> 00:04:30.480
You

00:05:02.170 --> 00:05:06.090
Ah, embroidery is hard, isn't it?

00:05:06.090 --> 00:05:09.810
I thought it was easy because Mayu always looks like she's having fun.

00:05:10.840 --> 00:05:13.280
Mayu is amazing, isn't she?

00:05:15.860 --> 00:05:16.920
Yukino is amazing!

00:05:17.320 --> 00:05:19.400
Look at ours too!

00:05:19.980 --> 00:05:20.420
Hmm?

00:05:22.910 --> 00:05:23.590
What's that?

00:05:23.750 --> 00:05:24.580
It's a tree!

00:05:24.840 --> 00:05:25.240
It's wheat!

00:05:25.680 --> 00:05:26.260
Ehh?

00:05:26.340 --> 00:05:27.440
Wheat!

00:05:30.220 --> 00:05:31.040
It's cute, isn't it?

00:05:31.240 --> 00:05:46.770
While everyone is sleeping

00:05:46.770 --> 00:05:47.510
What?

00:05:47.810 --> 00:05:53.050
I can eat anything when I'm in the form of a person

00:05:53.770 --> 00:05:55.750
It's no good to eat when you go back to the cat

00:05:56.630 --> 00:05:57.670
Of course

00:05:57.670 --> 00:05:59.440
No way

00:06:00.190 --> 00:06:00.550
That's right!

00:06:00.850 --> 00:06:05.470
Here, eat it, Mayu.

00:06:05.510 --> 00:06:08.040
I-I can eat it by myself!

00:06:08.220 --> 00:06:10.960
The fish is delicious and good for your health.

00:06:11.180 --> 00:06:12.340
I have to eat a lot.

00:06:12.660 --> 00:06:17.940
See, it's on you, Mayu.

00:06:17.980 --> 00:06:28.350
Yuki-chan really loves Nekoyashiki-san.

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:31.490
That's right.

00:06:31.670 --> 00:06:34.500
Nekoyashiki Yuki-san.

00:06:34.580 --> 00:06:34.900
Huh?

00:06:35.180 --> 00:06:39.760
Kibu?

00:06:39.880 --> 00:06:41.600
That graceful look.

00:06:42.100 --> 00:06:43.120
Overflowing aura.

00:06:43.580 --> 00:06:46.440
We've been looking for someone like Yuki-san all along.

00:06:47.400 --> 00:06:49.940
Princesses and ice fairies.

00:06:50.080 --> 00:06:51.440
It looks really good on you.

00:06:51.580 --> 00:06:52.320
Yeah, yeah.

00:06:52.440 --> 00:06:55.060
Please come to our theater club.

00:06:55.280 --> 00:06:57.990
Mayu, are you going in?

00:06:58.610 --> 00:06:58.830
Huh?

00:07:00.350 --> 00:07:02.730
I don't want to go out in front of people.

00:07:03.330 --> 00:07:06.620
Then I won't go in, either.

00:07:07.220 --> 00:07:09.740
Yuki-chan...

00:07:09.740 --> 00:07:12.310
Hey, what role do you think wheat should play?

00:07:12.980 --> 00:07:15.280
Like a dog?

00:07:16.330 --> 00:07:25.630
I'm going to a dog school, so why don't you become friends with people other than me?

00:07:26.310 --> 00:07:27.530
No need.

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:40.880
The reason I want to be here is because I want to be with Mayu, and I want to protect Mayu, so I'm happy to be in the form of a person and be with Mayu all the time.

00:08:02.430 --> 00:08:03.860
Is that the embroidery from the previous lesson?

00:08:04.580 --> 00:08:07.550
Yes, Yuuki taught me.

00:08:08.200 --> 00:08:10.190
I'm getting better at it.

00:08:10.810 --> 00:08:11.250
Oh!

00:08:12.280 --> 00:08:16.140
Since we're here, we thought we'd embroider something.

00:08:16.560 --> 00:08:19.290
Satoru, what kind of embroidery did you embroider?

00:08:19.630 --> 00:08:20.780
This is it.

00:08:21.720 --> 00:08:26.740
Thank you.

00:08:26.880 --> 00:08:28.280
I embroidered it to give it to Daifuku as a present.

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:36.010
If I think about giving it to someone, I might get motivated!

00:08:36.330 --> 00:08:39.780
Hey, why don't we all exchange the handkerchiefs we collected?

00:08:42.790 --> 00:08:46.230
Me and Mayu-chan, and Yuki-chan and Mugi-chan, we'll exchange them!

00:08:46.550 --> 00:08:51.760
I won't do that, absolutely.

00:09:02.840 --> 00:09:06.520
I...want to...交換したいな

00:09:06.520 --> 00:09:07.480
Mayu

00:09:07.480 --> 00:09:14.510
I'm going to make a wonderful handkerchief, so please look forward to it!

00:09:18.420 --> 00:09:19.920
Can I embroider here too?

00:09:20.340 --> 00:09:22.470
I want to make the clothes a little more fluffy

00:09:23.030 --> 00:09:24.650
Of course!

00:09:24.930 --> 00:09:25.150
Huh?

00:09:26.360 --> 00:09:29.310
Mayu-chan

00:09:29.310 --> 00:09:29.980
This...

00:09:39.270 --> 00:09:43.000
What? Mayu?

00:09:43.080 --> 00:09:45.160
Come here, Mayu-chan.

00:09:45.200 --> 00:09:48.560
You're so focused that you can't even hear other people's voices.

00:09:49.180 --> 00:09:50.390
You're so cool!

00:10:01.120 --> 00:10:01.640
Yuki-chan?

00:10:01.900 --> 00:10:05.510
I'm also-

00:10:06.400 --> 00:10:07.060
Komugi-chan!

00:10:07.200 --> 00:10:09.560
I think Yuki-chan only calls Inukai-san...

00:10:10.740 --> 00:10:14.850
Yuki-chan, what's wrong?

00:10:16.400 --> 00:10:17.080
You...

00:10:17.080 --> 00:10:19.570
You're different from that girl.

00:10:20.370 --> 00:10:21.480
That girl?

00:10:40.490 --> 00:10:44.420
Mayu had a very close friend at her previous school.

00:10:44.860 --> 00:10:52.590
Mayu decided to give her a handkerchief as a present on her child's birthday.

00:10:52.690 --> 00:10:55.720
She embroidered a chinchilla that she had been holding.

00:11:00.350 --> 00:11:03.010
To make it on time for her birthday, I made some time off.

00:11:03.630 --> 00:11:09.220
But when Mai focuses, I can't hear the voices around her.

00:11:09.640 --> 00:11:29.850
I didn't notice the voice of my friend who was talking to me, so we...

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:32.940
Without any misunderstanding, we became no longer friends.

00:11:33.400 --> 00:11:48.370
I don't want Mayu to get hurt anymore.

00:11:48.950 --> 00:11:55.310
If you do, I don't want you to get close to her from the start.

00:11:55.370 --> 00:11:57.560
I don't need a friend to hurt Mayu one day.

00:12:03.480 --> 00:12:04.520
I don't know at all.

00:12:06.510 --> 00:12:11.200
I'm good friends with Iroha, but I've had a fight with her.

00:12:11.760 --> 00:12:15.280
Yuki had a fight with Mayu, didn't she?

00:12:16.040 --> 00:12:16.840
That's...

00:12:16.840 --> 00:12:24.100
I had a fight with Iroha and it was sad, but we got along well.

00:12:24.520 --> 00:12:27.400
Iroha and I will be together forever.

00:12:30.990 --> 00:12:40.790
It's sad to stop getting along with you today because you might have a fight tomorrow.

00:12:40.950 --> 00:12:44.860
It's better than having a hard time.

00:12:45.660 --> 00:12:48.000
I want to get along with Yuki-chan more.

00:12:49.260 --> 00:12:52.900
We might have a fight, but...

00:12:52.900 --> 00:12:58.890
Maybe that's better.

00:13:01.660 --> 00:13:13.640
Inukai-san and the others will be back soon.

00:13:13.760 --> 00:13:20.390
I can't hear the voices around me anymore.

00:13:21.970 --> 00:13:24.610
If I were ignoring what Iroha-chan and the others were talking about...

00:13:26.820 --> 00:13:29.630
Inukai-san is the daughter of Neko-Yashiki-san.

00:13:30.000 --> 00:13:32.440
I told you to concentrate and it's amazing.

00:13:32.640 --> 00:13:37.480
It's okay.

00:13:37.700 --> 00:13:55.050
What's wrong?

00:14:02.750 --> 00:14:03.830
You two, back to your seats.

00:14:18.420 --> 00:14:25.260
Nobody's coming...

00:14:25.260 --> 00:14:26.560
I'm gonna eat snacks!

00:14:26.880 --> 00:14:28.120
Ocean Pike!

00:14:33.830 --> 00:14:37.080
Why is she so energetic?

00:14:37.480 --> 00:14:40.770
When wheat is sleepy, it becomes energetic in the opposite way.

00:14:41.690 --> 00:14:42.790
Iroha!

00:14:43.030 --> 00:14:43.720
I woke up!

00:14:43.940 --> 00:14:44.520
I woke up!

00:14:44.580 --> 00:14:45.160
I woke up!

00:14:46.530 --> 00:14:56.810
Curitiba! My Evolution!

00:15:32.360 --> 00:15:35.930
A world colored with Min's smile, Cure Flame!

00:15:38.420 --> 00:15:44.890
Let me hear your voice, Purukuri-kyo!

00:15:44.990 --> 00:15:48.520
...Wonderful.

00:16:00.990 --> 00:16:11.250
Sparkles in my eyes

00:16:20.150 --> 00:16:20.720
Wow, so cute!

00:16:31.240 --> 00:16:33.410
I'll be the one to shine!

00:16:35.540 --> 00:16:35.920
I'm a man!

00:16:36.340 --> 00:16:37.140
I'll keep quiet!

00:16:37.600 --> 00:16:40.910
I'll take you on a ride!

00:16:41.030 --> 00:16:43.840
Cure Lilian!

00:16:43.960 --> 00:16:46.140
I'm not scared!

00:16:46.480 --> 00:16:47.470
I'm not scared!

00:16:48.170 --> 00:16:53.840
Full Precure!

00:17:00.320 --> 00:17:01.950
Not bad. I like it.

00:17:02.310 --> 00:17:04.500
He's sleeping so comfortably.

00:17:05.240 --> 00:17:09.680
This GaruGaru is like a panda's GaruGaru.

00:17:10.180 --> 00:17:13.120
At the same time as GaruGaru was sleeping, everyone fell asleep.

00:17:13.480 --> 00:17:15.870
If I wake GaruGaru up, everyone will wake up!

00:17:32.910 --> 00:17:33.970
It's dangerous if you jump out of the water.

00:17:34.330 --> 00:17:37.370
Marugaru, wake up!

00:17:45.670 --> 00:17:47.960
You're lying! I'm sleeping but you're not getting any closer!

00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:01.800
I'm fine. Lilia, you have to...

00:18:01.800 --> 00:18:05.940
I'm fine. Lilia, you have to...

00:18:05.940 --> 00:18:07.400
I can't sleep because of the pain.

00:18:07.560 --> 00:18:11.880
I can't sleep because of the pain.

00:18:11.880 --> 00:18:13.160
I can't sleep because of the pain.

00:18:15.640 --> 00:18:18.050
Panda... Tire is fun.

00:18:19.450 --> 00:18:24.080
If you're that energetic...

00:18:25.800 --> 00:18:27.470
I'll take you on a trip!

00:18:32.332 --> 00:18:32.832
Nyan

00:19:00.570 --> 00:19:14.920
It's the power of Darin Kitsune-san!

00:19:34.160 --> 00:19:59.890
Go, go, go.

00:20:00.000 --> 00:20:01.970
I'll play with you.

00:20:31.920 --> 00:20:41.050
Goodbye, Precure!

00:21:03.800 --> 00:21:04.020
Come here!

00:21:30.000 --> 00:21:48.190
More importantly, what is this?

00:21:49.060 --> 00:21:50.450
Ah! It's a snowman!

00:21:51.690 --> 00:21:52.030
Snow?

00:21:52.290 --> 00:21:59.840
And then...

00:22:00.250 --> 00:22:00.570
You have to do it.

00:22:01.090 --> 00:22:04.140
It seems that Komuni-chan and Yuki-chan have become a little closer.

00:22:05.840 --> 00:22:08.310
Yuki, it looks fun.

00:22:08.470 --> 00:22:12.730
From now on, it will get better and better.

00:23:47.490 --> 00:23:48.970
Hey, Yuki, what is that?

00:23:49.410 --> 00:23:51.470
It's like an agility dog sport.

00:23:52.110 --> 00:23:54.110
Dog sport? Cool!

00:23:54.590 --> 00:23:56.030
Oh, it looks like Komuni-chan is also challenging!

00:23:56.790 --> 00:23:58.060
I wonder if she can do it well!

00:23:58.400 --> 00:23:59.270
